VALUES ('8ca55243-0ef3-5207-850d-013008de2fd1', 'phase-05-lesson-22-recursive-ctes-hierarchies-trees-graphs-i', 5, 22, 'Recursive CTEs: Hierarchies, Trees, & Graphs in SQL', '- **Status**: `[State: Active | Complete Specification | Core]`
- **Prerequisites**: Lesson 5.21
