VALUES ('5648ffdd-d520-5935-aced-71557ba0825e', 'phase-06-lesson-26-react-18-19-concurrent-features-usetransi', 6, 26, 'React 18/19 Concurrent Features: useTransition & useDeferredValue', '- **Status**: `[State: Active | Complete Specification | Core]`
- **Prerequisites**: Lesson 6.18, Lesson 6.22
