VALUES ('ed115c95-9bd7-5e11-be33-1d05ff538583', 'phase-06-lesson-37-advanced-frontend-virtualization-infinite', 6, 37, 'Advanced Frontend Virtualization & Infinite Scrolling', '- **Status**: `[State: Active | Complete Specification | Core]`
- **Prerequisites**: Lesson 6.1, Lesson 6.13
- **Subtopics**:
