VALUES ('26627893-2d5f-58f9-89cc-5b46837f1c89', 'phase-09-lesson-28-building-an-autograd-engine-v-loss-module', 9, 28, 'Building an Autograd Engine V: Loss Modules, Optimizers & GradFlow Validation', '- **Status**: `[State: Active | Complete Specification | Core]`
